sequenceDiagram
    participant P0 as Administrator
    participant P1 as API
    participant P2 as PostgreSQL
    participant P3 as Source
    participant P4 as Adapter
    participant P5 as Admission
    participant P6 as Scheduler
    participant P7 as Evaluation
    participant P8 as Recovery
    P0->>P1: S01 Read or propose a scoped collection policy with expected revision
    P1->>P1: S02 Verify current grants provider quotas supported delivery and freshness basis
    alt S02 accepted
        Note over P1: Continue only with accepted scoped context
    else denied, stale or incomplete
        break F1 stop this path
            Note over P1: Retain restrictive disposition; no later success steps
        end
    end
    P1->>P2: S03 Atomically retain policy idempotent command audit and outbox
    P3->>P4: S04 Send event or polled observation with source observation time
    P4->>P5: S05 Use existing evidence or workload event contract with source-bound identity
    P5->>P5: S06 Verify integrity scope order dedupe observation time and coverage
    alt S06 accepted
        Note over P5: Continue only with accepted scoped context
    else denied, stale or incomplete
        break F1 stop this path
            Note over P5: Retain restrictive disposition; no later success steps
        end
    end
    P5->>P2: S07 Atomically retain admitted receipt expiry context audit and outbox
    P6->>P6: S08 Claim due material window or expiry work with fenced lease, urgent controls bypass debounce
    alt S08 accepted
        Note over P6: Continue only with accepted scoped context
    else denied, stale or incomplete
        break F1 stop this path
            Note over P6: Retain restrictive disposition; no later success steps
        end
    end
    P6->>P7: S09 Evaluate exact objective graph policy and qualified evidence
    P7->>P8: S10 Propose bounded response or return restrictive conclusion
    P8->>P8: S11 Recheck current authority grants evidence and exact target before dispatch
    alt S11 accepted
        Note over P8: Continue only with accepted scoped context
    else denied, stale or incomplete
        break F1 stop this path
            Note over P8: Retain restrictive disposition; no later success steps
        end
    end
    Note over P0,P8: F1 Missing stale revoked or indeterminate evidence stays Unknown or blocked. Retry with fencing, receipt and timestamps do not prove healthy recovery.
